WEBVTT

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.700
<b>My Next Life
as a Villainess:
All Routes 
Lead to Doom!</b>

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.060
<i>The time has finally come.</i>

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>Here at this magic academy 
is where the game begins...</i>

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:35.300
<i>and where I, Catarina Claes, 
meet my doom.</i>

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.210
But...

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.720
I won't let that happen.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.380
Bring it on if you dare, doom flag!

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.030
I'll take you on!

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:58.490
<b>Capital of the Kingdom of Sorcier</b>

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.200
<b>Royal Palace</b>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.660
No! I hate this!

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.820
Why is the ribbon blue?!

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.420
Change it this instant!

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.880
B-But you chose this ribbon yourself...

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.380
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.200
I'm in the mood for a pink one right now!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.920
W-We don't have any others ready.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.980
Ugh! You people are useless!

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.130
You're all fired!

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:23.470
Ah, my adorable Catarina!

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.380
Father!

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.050
This is Geordo Stuart, 
the third prince of the kingdom.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.150
Go on, introduce yourself.

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:38.440
How do you do? I am Catarina Claes.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:44.060
It's an honor to meet you, Miss Catarina.

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:45.750
I am Geordo Stuart.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:53.010
Our gardener takes meticulous 
care of these flowers.

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:54.880
What kind of flowers do 
you like, Miss Catarina?

00:01:56.270 --> 00:01:57.960
U-Um...

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:01.840
My feet hurt. 
I can't keep walking on my own.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.520
Maybe I've developed blisters...

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.520
In that case, you should 
return to your room.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.770
As long as I do this, I'm all right!

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:08.680
But...

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.150
What's his problem? How rude!

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:17.470
That was my younger brother, Alan.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.730
Oh! But he doesn't look 
the slightest bit like you!

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:23.780
Most people say that.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.370
Your feet seem to be all 
right now, Miss Catarina.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.010
Please, wait!

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.910
Master Geordo!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.030
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.140
<i>Who are these people?</i>

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:55.020
<i>This view looks familiar...</i>

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.870
<i>What is this monkey doing?</i>

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.330
<i>Ah, I can't stand dogs.</i>

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:04.170
<i>For some reason, they used to bark 
at me every morning.</i>

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.870
<i>Wait, why do I know that?</i>

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:09.140
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:12.860
<i>Is this a closet? Or perhaps a doghouse?</i>

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.880
<i>No... I know what this is.</i>

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.120
<i>It's... my room!</i>

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.050
<i>And this is...</i>

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.300
Me?!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.250
Are you all right, Miss Catarina?!

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.510
Catarina! Catarina!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:32.270
Are you all right, Miss Catarina? 
Can you hear me?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.850
<i>That was... me?</i>

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.850
Call a doctor!

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:37.380
Catarina, if you can hear me, please answer!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:37.380
<i>I hit the fast track to becoming 
an otaku in middle school.</i>

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.450
<i>In high school, I got hooked on otome games,</i>

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.280
<i>and after playing one all night, 
I was running late for school,</i>

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.830
<i>so I rushed out into the street...</i>

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.720
<i>I died at the age of seventeen!</i>

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.530
<i>That wasn't a dream! They were 
my memories from my previous life!</i>

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:53.960
Miss Catarina!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.200
<b>A Few Days Later   The Claes Mansion</b>

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.090
How are you feeling?

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:01.550
I feel much better. My fever has gone down.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.260
Oh, good...

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.680
I'm so sorry I caused 
an injury to your face.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:10.610
No, no! I'm the one who should apologize!

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.940
I've caused everyone such worry.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:18.800
Besides, this is just a scratch. 
It's nothing to worry about.

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.530
B-But even if it doesn't bother you,

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.440
the rest of high society 
won't feel the same.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:27.240
It might even hurt your 
chances of getting married.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.570
R-Right...

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:31.150
<i>High society, huh?</i>

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:33.470
I was thinking, and I believe you 
and I should get engaged.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:34.010
<i>Being nobility seems like a lot 
more trouble than it's worth.</i>

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.080
Of course, I will respect 
your wishes, as well.

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.890
<i>Compared to that, I had a lot 
of freedom in my previous life.</i>

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:39.740
Would that be all right 
with you, Miss Catarina?

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:40.920
Uh... Yes!

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:45.880
In that case, I shall return to 
present myself formally on another day.

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:51.460
Present himself?

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:55.070
Miss Catarina! Congratulations!

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:56.400
Huh? For what?

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.550
For what?! Your engagement 
to Master Geordo, of course!

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:03.440
What?!

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:06.580
We've already been informed. 
Congratulations!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.160
I expected nothing less 
of my adorable Catarina!

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.190
Imagine, a prince falling 
for you at first sight!

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:13.650
Uh, Master Geordo simply felt 
responsible for my injury...

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:13.650
Indeed!

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:15.040
We must celebrate tonight!

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.700
Yes, let's!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.980
We'll have to throw 
an engagement party, too!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:20.540
I-I'm still not feeling very well, 
so I'll be going now...

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.540
Oh, that's a great idea!

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.430
What should I do?

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.550
Master Geordo is wonderful,

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.650
but I can't feel romantically 
attracted to an eight-year-old.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.900
<i>I'm a seventeen-year-old otaku 
chick on the inside, after all.</i>

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.160
<i>Being part of high society 
is depressing enough,</i>

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.180
<i>but being engaged to a prince?</i>

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.020
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:44.700
<i>there was a similar story 
in an otome game I played.</i>

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:49.200
<i>Prince Geordo was black-hearted and sadistic, 
but he had a gorgeous smile.</i>

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:53.340
<i>The evil rich girl he was engaged to 
blamed him for a wound on her forehead,</i>

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:54.860
<i>so she kept him confined...</i>

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.250
<i>Wait... Prince Geordo?</i>

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:02.250
<b>Character Profiles
☆Other Characters☆
</b>In addition to the characters with playable routes,
the game features many other charming characters.
Some are friendly toward the heroine,
but of course, there are also rivals!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:02.250
<b>Rival Villainess
Catarina Claes
</b>The daughter of the noble Claes family.
To assume responsibility for
an incident during their childhood in which
her forehead was injured, Prince Geordo...

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:02.250
<i>That villainess did have a name...</i>

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.550
<b>Rival Villainess
Catarina Claes
</b>The daughter of the noble Claes family.
To assume responsibility for
an incident during their childhood in which
her forehead was injured, Prince Geordo...

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.800
Catarina Claes?!

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.510
<i>That... That can't be...</i>

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:14.480
<i>It's too soon to conclude 
that this is the world of that otome game!</i>

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.870
<i>I have to remember everything!</i>

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.640
<i></i>Fortune Lover<i>.</i>

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.720
<i>An otome game set in a magic 
academy in a certain nation,</i>

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:32.570
<i>it's all about fostering romantic 
relationships with the characters.</i>

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:37.280
<i>The heroine, Maria, is a commoner 
who possesses light magic.</i>

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:41.130
<i>She enters the magic academy at age fifteen,</i>

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.260
<i>and there, she meets the four love interests.</i>

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.520
<i>The first is Geordo Stuart, 
the third prince of the kingdom.</i>

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.230
<i>If I'm by your side,</i>

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:53.870
<i>I'll never know boredom as long as I live.</i>

00:06:56.090 --> 00:07:00.350
<i>The second is Geordo's younger 
twin brother, Alan Stuart.</i>

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.270
<i>I-It's not like I was looking 
for you or anything, okay?</i>

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.050
<i>I just happened to be passing by.</i>

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:12.090
<i>The third is Catarina's 
adopted brother, Keith Claes.</i>

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:14.950
<i>Pretty young miss, 
would you like to play with me?</i>

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:20.540
<i>The fourth is the son 
of the premier, Nicol Ascart.</i>

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.820
<i>You have such fantastic ideas.</i>

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.820
<i>And then there's...</i>

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.120
<i>Catarina Claes.</i>

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.580
<i>She's Geordo's fiancée, and the villainess.</i>

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:35.300
<i>And the fate she meets 
if you play Geordo's route...</i>

