00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:22.740
It is the duty of all who possess magic 
to attend the magic academy.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:23.970
Take a look.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:27.690
Catarina manifested her earth 
magic at the age of five.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:34.550
There it is! The Earth Bump!

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:37.730
That was the first time we managed 
to make a bump in the earth!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:42.300
We really have to go to school 
to learn about wimpy magic like that?!

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:46.090
Wouldn't it be best to simply 
not bully the game's heroine?

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.220
B-But...

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:51.020
Isn't there a chance we could still 
be made out to be the evil mastermind?

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:52.500
What do you mean?

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:56.600
Geordo is a black-hearted prince 
who wears the mask of an angel.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:00.810
Isn't it possible he might vilify Catarina 
in order to end up with the heroine?

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:01.600
Oh, no!

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.950
So what should we do, then?!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.930
Please calm down, everyone.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.720
I have a great idea!

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:11.420
We'll brush up on our swordsmanship 
in case we're ever about to be killed!

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:14.290
And we should boost our magical power, too.

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:16.070
If we can use magic well enough,

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:19.240
we won't have trouble finding 
work even if we're exiled!

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:27.480
Then are we all in agreement that we 
should improve our sword and magic skills?

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:29.000
No objections!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.600
She's been acting strange 
since she got injured.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:36.800
<b>Episode 1
I Recalled the Memories of My Past Life...</b>

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:37.050
But the doctor said everything was normal...

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:46.810
<b>"Easy to Understand!! Introduction to Magic"</b>

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.970
"To boost one's magical power,

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:47.670
it is essential to converse 
with the source of one's magic," huh?

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:49.980
That's it!

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:56.780
Miss Catarina, 
what in the world are you doing?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:00.060
I'm conversing with the earth 
to boost my magical power!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:02.900
What better way to converse 
with the earth than by farming?

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:07.080
Farming is how we talk to the earth.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:10.260
<i>Thank you for teaching me just 
the lesson I needed, Grandma!</i>

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:12.360
I have no idea what you're talking about,

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:15.050
and I have a feeling that 
you're fundamentally mistaken...

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:18.330
But this is far more 
important, Miss Catarina!

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.760
Master Geordo is here to see you!

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:26.390
Miss... Catarina?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.200
Madam!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:31.900
Good day, Miss Catarina.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:34.360
May I ask what you're doing?

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:37.000
<i>Geordo is the black-hearted, 
sadistic prince.</i>

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.680
<i>His cheerful expression looks 
like the devil's smile...</i>

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:42.860
Good day, Master Geordo.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:46.570
I'm communing with the earth 
in order to train my magic.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:47.280
Huh?

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:51.500
I felt that starting a farm 
would be the best way to do that.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.480
Communing... with the earth?

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.600
Starting a... farm?

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.220
<i>Oh, no! Did I make him mad?!</i>

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.630
I see!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.130
That's a new and unique way to train!

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:09.610
<i>Oh, good! He's not mad!</i>

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:12.350
<i>I thought I was about to be exiled!</i>

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.560
Miss Catarina...

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.090
I've come to present myself to you formally.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:22.320
Will you accept my proposal of marriage?

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.320
Oh... Yes.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.410
<i>Crap! Now I've done it!</i>

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:35.150
Congratulations, Miss Catarina!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.670
<i>A wound on my forehead 
and an engagement to the prince...</i>

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:49.450
<i>This is turning out just like the game.</i>

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:52.550
<i>But I don't want to die young again.</i>

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:55.030
<i>I'm going to live out my life this time!</i>

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.500
Catarina.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:12.030
This is Keith. He's going to 
be your brother from now on.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.650
I-It's nice to meet you.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:17.710
<i>And there's the second doom flag!</i>

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.000
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.460
"Keith Claes.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.880
A distant relative of the Claes family

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:26.340
who had a very lonely upbringing.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:30.010
Because he was the son of a mistress, 
he was bullied by his siblings.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:33.740
Even after the Claes family took 
him in, Catarina bullied him,

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:36.020
so he spent most of his 
time locked up in his room.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.760
As if to bury 
the loneliness of his childhood,

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:43.400
Keith grew into a frivolous playboy 
who fooled around with many girls.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.650
But after meeting the game's heroine,

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:50.490
his loneliness is soothed 
and he falls in love for real.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:52.640
And when Catarina interferes with that,

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:55.370
she's either exiled or killed using magic!"

00:14:56.330 --> 00:15:00.040
As of right now, everything's 
progressing just like it did in the game!

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:02.370
What's more, Keith is family.

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:05.000
There's no telling when he might kill us.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.470
Now that it's come to this, 
we'll have to take action while we can.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.490
You don't mean...

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:11.050
B-But we can't...

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:14.390
For our own sake, we have to!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:18.180
We have to put him in a box 
and dump him under a bridge!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:22.150
Please Take Me Home

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.250
We can't do something so cruel!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.150
I don't wanna do that, either!

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:23.730
Wait a moment.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:26.370
We just have to ensure 
that Keith is not lonely.

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:30.270
If he isn't lonely, he won't fall in love 
with the game's heroine,

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:32.530
and doom will not befall Catarina.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:37.250
B-But how do we do that?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.670
Well, shouldn't we just 
give him lots of attention?

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:41.360
That's a brilliant idea!

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:44.000
I always wanted a little brother!

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:48.760
Then, are we all in agreement 
that we must lavish Keith with attention?

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.930
No objections!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:51.600
Keith!

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.980
Since it's such a nice day, 
I'll show you the garden!

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:58.900
Thank you, Miss Catarina.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.280
We're brother and sister now.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.180
You can call me "Sister."

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:05.360
B-But wouldn't that be rude?

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.370
It's always been my dream 
to be called "Sister"!

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.200
Please, I insist you call me that!

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.910
Okay... Sister.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.980
These are eggplants, and those are tomatoes.

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:20.450
Are you the one who tends this garden?

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:21.690
Yes.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:24.100
I'll let you taste some 
fresh produce sometime.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.420
It's delicious!

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:33.350
There are fish in here. 
You can even go fishing.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.320
Really? You fish?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:37.510
Yeah! We can fish together sometime!

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:43.510
Now I'll show you my favorite place!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.830
Here it is!

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.290
The view from the top 
of this tree is the best!

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.440
What? You climb trees?

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.330
I do. Have you ever climbed a tree?

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.330
Then, I'll teach you how! Watch me!

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:15.050
<i>I was a tree-climbing 
expert in my previous life.</i>

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.270
<i>Everyone called me a wild monkey.</i>

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.810
Hey, Kei—

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:25.750
Ow...

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.280
Keith?!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.740
No! Don't die!

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.780
I finally got such a cute little brother!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.810
I can't believe I killed you with my butt!

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:36.660
S-Sister Catarina!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:40.910
Thank goodness! Keith!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.540
I was surprised when 
I heard you fell from a tree.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.960
I'm glad you're all right.

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:48.240
Yes...

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:50.680
I'm usually very good at climbing,

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.460
but I got carried away and fell.

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:54.630
I-I see...

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.880
And I landed on Keith,

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.800
so my mother was terribly angry with me.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:01.820
Now that you mention it, your parents

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:04.340
have seemed more affectionate than before.

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:06.730
Yes... Well, some things happened.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.720
Welcome, Prince!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.340
Mother mistakenly thought 
that Keith was Father's illegitimate son.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:11.890
They nearly got a divorce!

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.070
Since the misunderstanding 
was cleared up, they've been very loving.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:17.670
We're a perfectly happy family now.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.140
That's good to hear.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.710
You helped me make a lot 
of progress with the sword.

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:26.120
Thanks, Keith.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:26.820
Sure.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.920
And my farm's coming along great!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.980
This should give my magic a big boost!

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:31.960
Magic?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:35.170
Oh, yeah! You also have earth magic, right?

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.010
Huh? Y-Yeah...

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:41.360
Hey, would you show me what 
you can do with your magic?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:42.930
I'd like to learn from it!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.190
B-But...

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:46.680
Just a little bit! Please?

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:50.190
W-Well, if it's just a little...

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.700
That's amazing!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.050
When I pour magic into a dirt doll,

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:02.210
I can make it move how I want it to.

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:05.120
Can you move a bigger doll?

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.830
Well, yeah...

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:10.550
<i>Using dirt dolls would 
eliminate labor costs!</i>

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:14.170
<i>Even if I'm exiled, I could make a fortune!</i>

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:16.880
Show me, Keith! Please!

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:24.850
O-Okay.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.590
That's amazing!

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:32.170
You're a genius!

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:33.770
Now <i>this</i> is magic!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:36.680
Watch out! Don't get close to it!

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:40.520
Sister!

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:46.490
Catarina!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.080
Thank goodness! We were so worried!

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:51.460
F-Father...

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.210
How do you feel?

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.870
The doctor said you were all right, but still...

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:57.550
Yes, I feel fine.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.160
Wait, what about Keith?

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:00.170
He's fine.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:03.000
Oh... Thank goodness.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.550
Catarina, about Keith...

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:10.180
He has very strong magic,

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:13.160
but he doesn't have full control over it yet.

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:17.520
So he had promised us that he 
wouldn't use his magic for no reason.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:23.000
He once injured his brothers 
by letting his magic get out of control.

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:27.530
He knows very well how 
dreadful his magic can be,

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:31.200
so we were very surprised 
to hear that he had used it.

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.610
Keith has said that it was all his fault,

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:37.970
so he'll accept any punishment.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:40.480
No! It was my fault!

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.920
I talked him into using his magic!

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:45.960
He even warned me not to get close,

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:48.890
but I didn't listen and 
ran up to his doll anyway!

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:50.890
Catarina...

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.820
I have to apologize.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:58.380
Catarina!

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:05.740
Keith!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.350
Miss Catarina, I see you've awakened.

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:14.290
Yes... Where's Keith?

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:18.410
Well, he took the spare key 
and locked himself in his room.

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:19.340
What?!

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:24.220
It's me, Keith! I need to talk to you!

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:25.860
Could you open the door, please?

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:29.670
I'm sorry. I can't do that.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.460
Why not?

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:36.350
I can't be close to you anymore.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:40.010
<i>This is going to end 
up the same as the game!</i>

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.070
No, Keith!

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:43.690
Open the door!

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.020
Keith! Keith!

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.130
Look, a bird!

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:54.880
Move it!

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:58.680
Take that!

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:01.370
Fall!

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:02.880
C'mon!

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:03.880
Hit it!

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:05.660
So close!

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:11.340
S-Stop!

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:23.650
Y-You're a monster...

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:27.430
Monster...

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:28.850
How frightening...

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:30.450
Don't you ever leave that room!

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:31.870
He'll kill you. Don't get close.

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:36.740
<i>This is how it should be.</i>

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:40.790
<i>If I'm alone, I can't hurt anyone.</i>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:43.670
<i>I can live without hurting 
the people I care about.</i>

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:47.980
Keith!

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:52.380
If you're near the door, get away from it!

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:53.600
Wait... Miss Catarina!

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:55.120
What are you going to do?!

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:56.890
You'd better move, too, Anne! 
This'll be dangerous!

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:35.210
I'm sorry!

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:35.730
Huh?

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:40.170
Why are you apologizing?

00:23:40.170 --> 00:23:41.860
It was my fault.

00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:44.960
What are you talking about?! 
It was my fault!

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:47.600
I talked you into doing it!

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:50.430
You're not afraid of me?

00:23:50.430 --> 00:23:51.200
Huh?

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.360
At my other house, I hurt my brothers.

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:57.320
I could hurt you next!

00:23:57.320 --> 00:24:00.920
I always hurt people with my magic!

00:24:03.050 --> 00:24:05.330
Of course I'm not afraid.

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:10.540
You just need to start training 
so you can control your magic.

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:12.730
Let's work hard together, okay?

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:18.430
You'll... stay with me?

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:19.990
Of course!

00:24:19.990 --> 00:24:23.180
We'll always be together, Keith!

00:24:31.810 --> 00:24:34.250
Thank you, Sister...

00:24:36.380 --> 00:24:38.370
Catarina!

00:24:38.370 --> 00:24:40.490
Mother! I can explain!

00:24:40.490 --> 00:24:42.230
I don't need to hear excuses!

00:24:42.230 --> 00:24:43.510
Come to my room right now!

00:24:43.510 --> 00:24:47.010
I'm sorry, Mother!
